{"status":"ok","message-type":"work","message-version":"1.0.0","message":{"indexed":{"date-parts":[[2026,10,9]],"date-time":"2026-10-09T07:50:53Z","timestamp":1791532253726,"version":"4.3.4"},"reference-count":92,"publisher":"Wiley","issue":"8","license":[{"start":{"date-parts":[[2026,10,9]],"date-time":"2026-10-09T00:00:00Z","timestamp":1791504000000},"content-version":"vor","delay-in-days":0,"URL":"http:\/\/onlinelibrary.wiley.com\/termsAndConditions#vor"},{"start":{"date-parts":[[2026,10,9]],"date-time":"2026-10-09T00:00:00Z","timestamp":1791504000000},"content-version":"tdm","delay-in-days":0,"URL":"http:\/\/doi.wiley.com\/10.1002\/tdm_license_1.1"}],"funder":[{"DOI":"10.13039\/100020473","name":"Badan Riset dan Inovasi Nasional","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","award":["122\/IV\/KS\/11\/2022"],"award-info":[{"award-number":["122\/IV\/KS\/11\/2022"]}],"id":[{"id":"10.13039\/100020473","id-type":"DOI","asserted-by":"publisher"}]},{"DOI":"10.13039\/100020473","name":"Badan Riset dan Inovasi Nasional","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","award":["10979\/UN19\/HK.07.00\/2022"],"award-info":[{"award-number":["10979\/UN19\/HK.07.00\/2022"]}],"id":[{"id":"10.13039\/100020473","id-type":"DOI","asserted-by":"publisher"}]}],"content-domain":{"domain":["onlinelibrary.wiley.com"],"crossmark-restriction":true},"short-container-title":["Energy Storage"],"published-print":{"date-parts":[[2026,12]]},"abstract":"<jats:title>ABSTRACT<\/jats:title>\n                  <jats:p>\n                    Herein, agricultural waste of rice panicles was adopted as a raw precursor to prepare PAC using KOH activation at different concentrations (0, 0.25, 0.50, and 0.75\u2009M) coupled with CO\n                    <jats:sub>2<\/jats:sub>\n                    activation at 850\u00b0C and its implementation as symmetric supercapacitor electrodes. RPPAC\u20100.25\u2010850 exhibited high S\n                    <jats:sub>BET<\/jats:sub>\n                    , hierarchical porosity, and a high degree of graphitization. At 1\u2009A g\n                    <jats:sup>\u22121<\/jats:sup>\n                    , RPPAC\u20100.25\u2010850 attained a gravimetric capacitance of 280\u2009F\u2009g\n                    <jats:sup>\u22121<\/jats:sup>\n                    , Coulombic efficiency of 86.53%, and an impressive energy density of 38.95\u2009Wh\u2009kg\n                    <jats:sup>\u22121<\/jats:sup>\n                    at a power density of 413.5\u2009W\u2009kg\n                    <jats:sup>\u22121<\/jats:sup>\n                    . Likewise, the RPPAC\u20100.25\u2010850\u2010based symmetric SC device exhibited high GCD cycling stability, retaining 88% capacitance at 10\u2009A g\n                    <jats:sup>\u22121<\/jats:sup>\n                    after 6000 GCD cycles, suggesting superior capacitance efficiency. The results suggest that agricultural waste can be a sustainable energy storage solution, with optimal KOH activation conditions for exceptional SC performance, and also offers a viable potential route for greener, more efficient energy solutions.\n                  <\/jats:p>","DOI":"10.1002\/est2.70547","type":"journal-article","created":{"date-parts":[[2026,10,9]],"date-time":"2026-10-09T07:31:11Z","timestamp":1791531071000},"update-policy":"https:\/\/doi.org\/10.1002\/crossmark_policy","source":"Crossref","is-referenced-by-count":0,"title":["Sustainable Development of Interconnected Hierarchical Porous Carbon From Rice Panicle Waste: Synergistic\n                    <scp>KOH<\/scp>\n                    \/\n                    <scp>\n                      CO\n                      <sub>2<\/sub>\n                    <\/scp>\n                    Dual\u2010Activation Strategy for Advanced Symmetric Supercapacitors"],"prefix":"10.1002","volume":"8","author":[{"ORCID":"https:\/\/orcid.org\/0000-0003-1434-7606","authenticated-orcid":false,"given":"Awitdrus","family":"Awitdrus","sequence":"first","affiliation":[{"name":"Department of Physics Universitas Riau  Pekanbaru Indonesia"}],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"ORCID":"https:\/\/orcid.org\/0009-0003-3449-2146","authenticated-orcid":false,"given":"Alifia Andra","family":"Sakinah","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[{"name":"Department of Physics Universitas Riau  Pekanbaru Indonesia"}],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"ORCID":"https:\/\/orcid.org\/0000-0003-3761-4009","authenticated-orcid":false,"given":"Rakhmawati","family":"Farma","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[{"name":"Department of Physics Universitas Riau  Pekanbaru Indonesia"}],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"ORCID":"https:\/\/orcid.org\/0000-0002-2998-2904","authenticated-orcid":false,"given":"Iwantono","family":"Iwantono","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[{"name":"Department of Physics Universitas Riau  Pekanbaru Indonesia"}],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"ORCID":"https:\/\/orcid.org\/0000-0002-3669-1064","authenticated-orcid":false,"given":"Agustino","family":"Agustino","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[{"name":"Department of Physics Universitas Riau  Pekanbaru Indonesia"}],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]}],"member":"311","published-online":{"date-parts":[[2026,10,9]]},"reference":[{"key":"e_1_2_9_2_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1016\/j.ref.2024.100545"},{"key":"e_1_2_9_3_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1016\/j.gr.2023.08.018"},{"key":"e_1_2_9_4_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1016\/j.est.2024.114692"},{"key":"e_1_2_9_5_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1016\/j.est.2022.106042"},{"key":"e_1_2_9_6_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1016\/j.jpowsour.2021.230886"},{"key":"e_1_2_9_7_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1016\/j.gr.2023.03.003"},{"key":"e_1_2_9_8_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1002\/sstr.202300100"},{"key":"e_1_2_9_9_1","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1016\/j.fuel.2024.133707"},{"key":"e_1_2_9_10_1","d